.TH "drm_info" "1" "2026\-07\-14"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
drm_info \- dump information about DRM devices
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBdrm_info\fR [\-j] [device].\&.\&.\&
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBdrm_info\fR is a small utility to dump information about DRM devices.\&
.PP
\fIdevice\fR must be a path to a DRM device, e.\&g.\& "/dev/dri/card0".\& When omitted,
all available devices are printed.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-j\fR
.RS 4
Print information in JSON format.\& By default, the output will be
pretty\-printed in a human\-readable format.\&
.PP
.RE
